# FUBoot Tours — Terraform

- Naming: `{env}-fuboot-tours-...` and `shared-fuboot-tours-...`. Project tag `fuboot-tours`.
- Domains: `fuboot.7oas7er.com` (prod), `fuboot-stg.7oas7er.com` (stg).
- State bucket: `shared-fuboot-tours-terraform-state-bucket`.
- Site module is **S3 + CloudFront only** — no Lambda / `/api/scores`.
- Cloudflare root = DNS only; origin-verify + cache hosts live in platform shared-edge.
- Never commit `terraform.tfvars` or state.
